PAMAL RAN ME HOGAYA SHABBAR KA LADLA<br>
<br>
SHASH-MAHA PAR BHI AADA NE KAISE KIYA SITAM<br>
NANHA SA HALQ CHED KE QANJAR CHALA DIYA<br>
<br>
LASHOUN PE LASHE TANHA UTHATE THE SHAH-E-DEEN<br>
AAQA KO TERE SHIMR NE PHIR ZIBHA KAR-DIYA<br>
<br>
ROTI HAI YAAD KARKE SAKINA JO BAAP KO<br>
RONE SE USKE HOTA HAI TUKDE JIGAR MERA<br>
<br>
AYE HIND GHAM YE MUJH KO HAR GHAM SE HAI SIWA<br>
BE-GORO BE-KAFAN MERA MAJAYA RHE-GAYA<br>
